From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since44 0x30 one-shot (no CONTINUE_WRITE)

since43: 0x30 APP_CONFIG with IRQ live still ETIME (~1s), gpio=1,
IRQ stuck at 3. IDENTIFY 0x02 applied WR_CHUNK_SIZE=512, so ~4098-byte
0x30 became CONTINUE_WRITE — same split that kept 0x45 in RomBoot.

since44: 0x30 is one TCM message (HDL_WR_CHUNK_SIZE=0). s3c64xx splits
DMA at PACKET_CNT_MAX with CS held.

diff -ruN a/drivers/input/touchscreen/synaptics/td4150/synaptics_tcm_core.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/synaptics/td4150/synaptics_tcm_core.c
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/synaptics/td4150/synaptics_tcm_core.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/synaptics/td4150/synaptics_tcm_core.c
@@
